\" data-tex=\"$p\\in M$\">$p\\in M$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  V_p=\\{ v\\in T_pM\\mid DF_p(v)=v\\  \\text{ for all }F\\in S\\} ,  \\]\">\\[  V_p=\\{ v\\in T_pM\\mid DF_p(v)=v\\  \\text{ for all }F\\in S\\} ,  \\]</span> the intersection of the <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$+1$\">$+1$</span>-eigenspaces of the <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$DF_p$\">$DF_p$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F\\in S$\">$F\\in S$</span>. It is a linear subspace of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$T_pM$\">$T_pM$</span>. ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_GeodesicsAndDistance#def:pet-ch5-fixed-point-set","next":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_GeodesicsAndDistance#prop:pet-ch5-fixed-point-component-totally-geodesic","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_GeodesicsAndDistance#def:pet-ch5-fixed-point-set","title":"def:pet-ch5-fixed-point-set","label":"def:pet-ch5-fixed-point-set"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_GeodesicsAndDistance#prop:pet-ch5-fixed-point-component-totally-geodesic","title":"prop:pet-ch5-fixed-point-component-totally-geodesic","label":"prop:pet-ch5-fixed-point-component-totally-geodesic"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_GeodesicsAndDistance#prop:pet-ch5-fixed-point-totally-geodesic","title":"prop:pet-ch5-fixed-point-totally-geodesic","label":"prop:pet-ch5-fixed-point-totally-geodesic"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_GeodesicsAndDistance#def:pet-ch5-fixed-tangent-subspace","title":"def:pet-ch5-fixed-tangent-subspace","tex":"\\begin{definition}[the fixed tangent subspace]\n  \\label{def:pet-ch5-fixed-tangent-subspace}\n\n  \\source{petersen:page-0215}\n  \\uses{def:pet-ch5-fixed-point